[{"client_msg_id":"e1dec370-8c00-4be3-a62c-bb3c7ed78f58","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"英文校閲は出す金によってピンキリすぎるのであんまりアテにならないことも…","ts":"1635769117.084700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vK1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3ff12ee-f213-49a9-9258-08fbaeae0f09","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"会話だと相手がいるので自然とそうなる部分もある","ts":"1635768854.083600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P8ppr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"874f1e23-6a8f-4812-90a8-cb371e95ff29","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"赤ペン先生してくれる人かサービスを用意して書いていくのが良いと思います","ts":"1635768817.083000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8rab="}]},{"client_msg_id":"b1bd2913-4c70-41b3-89ae-423469d2f2f6","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"語学に限りませんが、フィードバックない練習はあんまり意味ないので\n一人で沢山書いてもそんなに…","ts":"1635768783.082300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KuSco"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ac67b5c6-3f62-4b00-b349-7060cbd57570","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"英語自体に慣れたいならたくさん喋るしかないですね","ts":"1635768680.081200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2dV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5975e05-6ac9-47ae-ab45-e0cc4c8b0634","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"論文書きたいなら当然参考になりますが","ts":"1635768667.080600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yL=pB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0ebf380-7246-423f-b40c-5eea344078c0","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あと論文は(分野によるけど)誤解を避けるためのいろんな表現での状況記述があるので、あまり参考にはならない...かも?","ts":"1635768639.080100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0SQq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a0eb3055-bd0d-4a51-82fe-0e9b080e399b","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"日本人にとって読みやすい英語は日本人が書いた英語だったりする（ので「これ日本人が書いた英語だな」ってのが読んでて分かったりする）","ts":"1635768596.079300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SCzq0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3b7f7d90-dbaa-447f-8c4b-4cdd2a89f692","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"いわゆる GitHub English だ","ts":"1635768553.077800","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1635768562.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hPG+H"}]},{"client_msg_id":"72d961ab-5b57-4ca8-8a7a-6f350726b878","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"ライティング目的でいうと、論文の英語は必ずしもお手本とは限らないのがネックですね。\n非ネイティブが書いてることも全く珍しくないので（英文校閲は通してたりするだろうけど）","ts":"1635768522.077300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NOU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"99adecce-0071-4a7e-b87b-3e5f2e6b3c72","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"まあ練習は目的によって変わりますよね\n論文とか技術記事ならとにかく語彙と構成に慣れる","ts":"1635768333.075500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"oZyQP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e5ee88c4-5981-4c24-a2ac-2c8b9673b92b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"論文読む方が（英語自体は）全然簡単なんですけどねえ","ts":"1635767733.073100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9cu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3d576877-ffb7-48de-90b8-777e3dd27ce6","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"日常会話できても論文読めないですしねー","ts":"1635767316.072300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"15/NN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20507ecb-e4bb-431c-9c48-27aa637b104b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あと分野によって出てくる語彙はだいたい決まってるので、慣れるまで頑張る…","ts":"1635767034.071900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7h=X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"edddee55-6fcf-4a1c-9a80-ed89f086c452","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあ、そのへんですよねえ \u0026gt; 推測","ts":"1635766997.071100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"shTa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1bc9ec44-5db7-4a6b-ae37-3456b9c74eef","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"意地悪ネタとしては、唐突にラテン語の警句とかはいってきたり","ts":"1635766990.070600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4aifM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f629ea96-7fb3-4fce-8d24-2a5fc1c52470","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"一文あたりの知らない単語が少なければ文脈からいけるので、そういうレベルの文章を選ぶ\nもしくは自分の知ってる分野の英語版を学ぶ\n文構造の単純な文章を選ぶ、あたり","ts":"1635766950.069100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"bgj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d97251a2-61ba-4f6d-a5a2-151e6c43aa15","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"prefix , suffix めちゃ大事","ts":"1635761526.065700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"daiji","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BAr2Y"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e4eeb1d-a300-48bd-9d95-0df9034d6470","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"あとは文章からの推測は、合せて既存知識からの単語推測もする(ad...とかa...とかre...とかil...とかから語幹を考える) とかもあわせてやってると思うけど、意識してやるといいかも\nとくに英語、語源がいろいろありすぎる...","ts":"1635760635.064900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4CiM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"43a52630-ea39-4f81-8cf6-66aaaf2dfaac","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CS1NKB9B2/p1635755182044700\u003e","ts":"1635760501.063100","attachments":[{"fallback":"[Nove