ginal":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Erw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32138727-28e8-4c00-870c-e70903ac6c2f","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"submitしてさあ飯食おうとか風呂入ろうってなっても意図がちゃんと伝わってるかとか気にしてしまってご飯の味が分からなくなる","ts":"1635756050.055200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zmYi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f8421024-dee5-47f8-ac11-23e336782f1f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"勢い大事","ts":"1635756005.054300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eoBkq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c42034f-d4d5-4ea0-a6ab-3f8c3896cd4f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"でないと無限に停滞して進まないし","ts":"1635755982.053500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q8A"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21e23223-7e1f-457c-8b80-d832fd62ba2b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"細かい文法など分からんので伝われば :yoshi: という気持ちで書いている","ts":"1635755973.053000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"daiji","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"epBTO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"549b49cc-4650-470c-b371-ba95f2edf89d","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"issueは難しい","ts":"1635755960.052500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ztzf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"78d5e6e3-ce76-4309-ac60-5a23abba41d7","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"人が相手ならコミュニケーションすれば良いのです。国際交流はぶっちゃけ勢いだ\n\u003chttps://gahako.com/comic/working_cat/07/05.html\u003e","ts":"1635755959.052400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"ultrafastparrot","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UGEQG12HJ","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lEV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ec4e7e99-e4e6-462b-ab72-74ceac87df5c","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"issue立てるとき、いつもこれで伝わるのか？という気持ちになっている","ts":"1635755774.050800","edited":{"user":"U9S4G0LJW","ts":"1635755777.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"me-too","count":1,"users":["U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nvl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c25cbdbc-5655-4f2c-b508-92394e116a47","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"概要を掴もうとしてまぁ大体こんなもんだよねと理解してもそれが正しいのかを検証する術がないという…","ts":"1635755740.050100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9PNGo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7ff0fab7-4bb2-451c-9f9f-9fac523fc042","type":"message","user":"U01D44KSY9Z","text":"日本語ですら解釈の余地が発生する人間なので英語で悩むステージにすら立ててない気がする","ts":"1635755622.048000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"esD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2f174e27-b596-4bff-b0f5-eef0c0ed99cc","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"問題なら答え、対話なら質問で解決できますが、英語のニュースとかで学んでいる場合は答えが付属しないのでそういった悩みは発生しそうですね。中学をアメリカで過ごした身で、個人的に語学ってRPG的なレベルアップがある気がしていて、もやもやしつつ学んでるとある時期を境に急に理解が進む気がします。なので、答えがないものは全容を掴めるかに焦点を置くのでもいいのかも? あんまり答えになってなくてすみません。","ts":"1635755535.047300","edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1635755564.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":3,"users":["U013QL1RAPN","UFHQ7TNT0","U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gsn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a0e0b72-6add-4885-8e41-4c5988737b75","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"質問なんですけど、自分英語を勉強している時によく「自分の理解(訳など)が正しいのかわからない」ってなるんですけど\n感じたことある人いますか？もしいたら、どうやって乗り越えたか教えていただきたい","ts":"1635755182.044700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IoQw+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a7120e90-a087-445c-a98f-7002acd2b565","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"きになる","ts":"1635757196.059100","thread_ts":"1635757171.058800","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Fw8zv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f45f88d0-9bc6-40e4-970b-c3b8fa3e02ee","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"単に著者にメールするだけですよー。既にアカデミックに書いたものはわざわざ秘密にしておく必要があまりない","ts":"1635757241.059400","thread_ts":"1635757171.058800","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1ue"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccb780c9-03fa-440a-ad18-a72bcd89b823","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"それって個人でやってもいいんでしょうか。\nあとはこれ共著っぽいのですが誰にやればいいとかあるんでしょうか?","ts":"1635757274.060500","thread_ts":"1635757171.058800","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5LjLz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08f4c6e2-1bda-47ba-aec9-f93381c8a5d8","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"やり方詳しく教えて頂きたい","ts":"1635757286.060900","thread_ts":"1635757171.058800","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2uDs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"774b066b-21e2-4756-ab6e-edbbd929eee4","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"単に著者にメール出すだけです。.ac.jpのメアドのほうがいいはいいですがなければgmailでも。","ts":"1635763907.065900","thread_ts":"1635757171.058800","parent_user_id":"UDPT2BZ6E","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7dVP"}]}]
